  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업하실 내용은 거의없으시구요.. 이틀간 부탁드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">연락주세요.. (이력서의 채용기간은 무시하셔도 됩니다.)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">------</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용내용</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">가. 채용 권자: 예봉중학교장</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">나. 채용 방식: 공개 채용</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다. 채용 교과, 채용 인원 및 채용 기간</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">연번</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용교과</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용인원</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용기간</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">비고</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">통합과학</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">유사교과&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">물리</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">,</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">화학</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">,</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">생물</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">,</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">지구</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">과학</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">교원자격증 소지자 지원 가능</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">명</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2024.10.2.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">), 2024.10.4.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">금</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(2</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">일간</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, 9</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">시간</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">9</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">시간&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">× 24,000</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">원</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">= 216,000</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">원</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">원서 접수</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">기간</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: 2024. 9. 5.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">목</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) ~ 채용시시</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">까지</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">접수 방법</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이메일</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(bluerosebsj@naver.com),&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방문</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">예봉중학교&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">층 교무실</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">,&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">☎&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">031-579-2522)</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a63adff790cc6696dc3aff759dc33d3067af3f3e?download\" data-file-name=\"2024학년도 예봉중 시간강사(통합과학) 채용 공고문(이력서 양식 포함).hwp\" data-file-size=\"77824\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DKIr%26dataid%3D2059%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240909102220&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa63adff790c